# EFNU Fuel API — Fuelings List
# GET /api/v1/fuelings
#
# Optional parameters:
#   start      Start date (YYYY-MM-DD)
#   end        End date (YYYY-MM-DD)
#   plane_id   Filter by aircraft ID
#   limit      Max rows (max 1000)
#   offset     Pagination offset

@baseUrl = https://efnu.fi/fueldev/club/api/v1
@apiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

### Get current month's fuelings (no date filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fuelings
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get fuelings for a specific date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/fuelings?start=2025-08-01&end=2025-08-31
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get fuelings for a specific aircraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/fuelings?start=2025-01-01&end=2025-12-31&plane_id=53
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get fuelings with limit and offset (pagination - page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fuelings?start=2025-01-01&end=2025-12-31&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get fuelings with limit and offset (pagination - page 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fuelings?start=2025-01-01&end=2025-12-31&limit=100&offset=100
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
